---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

---
<section class="relative py-32 bg-surface-dark overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-40">
    <Image
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577896851231-70ef18881754?w=1920&q=80"
      alt=""
      role="presentation"
      loading="lazy"
      width="1920"
      height="1080"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-surface-dark via-primary/80 to-surface-dark/90"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <span class="inline-block py-1 px-3 bg-secondary/20 text-secondary border border-secondary/30 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">
      Matrículas Abertas 2025/2026
    </span>
    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
      Venha fazer parte da família Sagrado
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xl text-white/80 mb-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light">
      Descubra por que tantas famílias confiam há mais de 25 anos na educação do Colégio Sagrado Coração de Jesus.
    </p>
    <p class="text-xl text-white/80 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light">
      Aqui, conhecimento, valores e acolhimento caminham juntos para formar cidadãos preparados para o futuro.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="#contato"
        class="inline-block bg-secondary hover:bg-white text-primary px-10 py-5 rounded-full text-lg font-bold shadow-2xl shadow-secondary/20 transition-all transform hover:scale-105 cursor-pointer"
      >
        Agendar Visita
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/5598987031316"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-block border-2 border-white/30 hover:border-white text-white hover:bg-white/10 px-10 py-5 rounded-full text-lg font-bold transition-all transform hover:scale-105 cursor-pointer"
      >
        Falar no WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
